  "content": "<p>One of our members is turning a Mini 4WD car into a track analyser. A sensor and battery mounted in the car&#39;s body record movement data during a run, helping him compare chassis setups and tune the car for the track.</p><p>The latest version sends live data over Bluetooth. In the video, you can see the car move and watch the sensor readings come in.<br /><a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/mini4wd\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>mini4wd</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/sensors\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>sensors</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/vehicledata\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>vehicledata</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/hackerspace\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>hackerspace</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/makerspace\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>makerspace</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/openworkshop\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>openworkshop</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/MunichMakerLab\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>MunichMakerLab</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/MuMaLab\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>MuMaLab</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/Kreativquartier\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>Kreativquartier</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/Kreativlabor\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>Kreativlabor</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/DIYMunich\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>DIYMunich</span></a></p>",
